{"2961860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Honcho", "steam_appid": 2961860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From the creator of <strong>Jalopy</strong>.</h2>Define the story of <strong>Keiko</strong>, a young girl whose grandfather's sudden passing drops her into the cut-throat yet lucrative world of <strong>Vending Machine Tycoonism.</strong> Untold wealth awaits - if you can become the next <strong>Honcho!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961860/extras/22bb3a5903fdea67794809bd499f9c55.poster.avif?t=1771928531\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961860/extras/22bb3a5903fdea67794809bd499f9c55.webm?t=1771928531\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961860/extras/22bb3a5903fdea67794809bd499f9c55.mp4?t=1771928531\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take on the Financial Clique</h2>Take on the Keiretsu and reclaim your grandfather's rightful spot amongst Japan's financial elite. Deliver packages, purchase real estate and expand your company to show them you're more than just another Sukeban.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Kei Truck of Legend!</h2>Purchase your Kei truck through auction and discover it's quirks. Customize, maintain and upgrade your way to a vehicle of legend.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Navigate procedurally-generated 1980's Japan.</h2>Complete deliveries, install vending machines, and explore a stylized Shōwa era Japan. From busy corporate streets to winding mountain paths.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vending Machine Tycoonism</h2>Discover a heartfelt story of betrayal, mystery and hope while navigating the cut-throat and lucrative world of Vending Machine Tycoonism.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_c